{
  "about": "<section id=\"about\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"about cream-bg section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap two-columns\">\n    <div class=\"about-copy reveal\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">01 / Who we are</p><h2>Our community is stronger<br>when we <em>show up.</em></h2><p class=\"lead\">Since 2023, OSI has brought people together to serve Oakland County.</p><p>Our work brings education, community service, and medical volunteering together. From food assistance and planting to the Rochester Heritage Festival and micro:bit learning, each is a way to care for the place we call home.</p><p>Our team includes <a class=\"scout-inline-link\" href=\"meet-the-team.html#scout-candidates\">three Eagle Scout candidates</a>.</p><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#journey\">Follow our journey</a><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"meet-the-team.html\">Meet the Team</a></div></div>\n    <div class=\"about-composition reveal\"><figure class=\"about-field\"><img src=\"assets/harvest-team-480.webp\" srcset=\"assets/harvest-team-480.webp 480w, assets/harvest-team-564.webp 564w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 85vw, 40vw\" width=\"564\" height=\"432\" alt=\"Three volunteers in a field with gloves and harvested produce\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Time together. Service that matters.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"about-plant\"><img src=\"assets/planting-team-900.webp\" srcset=\"assets/planting-team-480.webp 480w, assets/planting-team-900.webp 900w, assets/planting-team-1000.webp 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 85vw, 40vw\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1040\" alt=\"Two volunteers tending a planting bed with yellow gloves\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Showing up for our neighbors.</figcaption></figure><span class=\"about-badge\">Since<br><strong>2023</strong></span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"wrap service-links\" aria-label=\"Explore our service areas\"><a href=\"food-assistance.html\">Food assistance</a><a href=\"environmental-service.html\">Environmental service</a><a href=\"medical.html\">Medical volunteering</a><a href=\"community-events.html\">Community events</a><a href=\"education.html\">Education</a></div>\n</section>\n",
  "journey": "<section id=\"journey\" tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"journey sage-bg section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap journey-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">03 / Our journey</p><h2>Small beginnings.<br><em>Growing together.</em></h2></div><div class=\"journey-total\"><strong>12</strong><p>events since 2023</p><span>Moments from our service journey.</span></div></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap timeline\"><article id=\"year-2023\" class=\"timeline-entry reveal\" tabindex=\"-1\"><figure class=\"timeline-picture founding\"><img src=\"assets/osi-community-green.png\" srcset=\"assets/osi-community-green.png 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 85vw, 40vw\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Oakland Service Initiative green community O logo with three connected nodes\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"timeline-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">2023</p><h3>Oakland Service Initiative begins.</h3><p>Oakland Service Initiative begins, bringing community service across the Oakland region into focus.</p></div></article>\n<article id=\"absolute-event\" class=\"timeline-entry reveal\" tabindex=\"-1\"><figure class=\"timeline-picture collaborator\"><img src=\"assets/absolute-logo.webp\" srcset=\"assets/absolute-logo.webp 334w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 85vw, 40vw\" width=\"334\" height=\"148\" alt=\"Absolute Home Health and Hospice official logo\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"timeline-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">2024</p><h3>Volunteering with Absolute Home Health and Hospice</h3><div class=\"event-hours\"><strong>300+</strong><span>volunteer hours</span></div><p>OSI volunteers contributed 300+ hours with Absolute Home Health and Hospice, one of our collaborators.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://absolutehhh.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Meet our collaborator</a></div></article>\n<article id=\"year-2026\" class=\"timeline-entry reveal\" tabindex=\"-1\"><figure class=\"timeline-picture \"><img src=\"assets/festival-booth-900.webp\" srcset=\"assets/festival-booth-480.webp 480w, assets/festival-booth-900.webp 900w, assets/festival-booth-1247.webp 1247w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 85vw, 40vw\" width=\"1247\" height=\"1615\" alt=\"An OSI volunteer demonstrates a planting activity to a visitor at the festival booth\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"timeline-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">May 30–31, 2026</p><h3>Rochester Heritage Festival</h3><p>The Rochester Heritage Festival, with 7,000 people, was our largest event. OSI volunteers welcomed visitors to planting activities and hands-on learning at our booth.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"community-events.html\">The festival story</a></div></article>\n<article id=\"burgess-milestone\" class=\"timeline-entry reveal\" tabindex=\"-1\"><figure class=\"timeline-picture \"><img src=\"assets/nature-center-900.webp\" srcset=\"assets/nature-center-480.webp 480w, assets/nature-center-900.webp 900w, assets/nature-center-1000.webp 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 85vw, 40vw\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1040\" alt=\"Two OSI volunteers plant beside boulders at Burgess-Shadbush Nature Center\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"timeline-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">June 19–20, 2026</p><h3>500 plants. Two days.</h3><p>Volunteers planted 500 plants at Burgess-Shadbush Nature Center, putting care for our local environment into action.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"environmental-service.html\">See the planting project</a></div></article>\n<article id=\"festival-hills-milestone\" class=\"timeline-entry reveal\" tabindex=\"-1\"><figure class=\"timeline-picture city\"><img src=\"assets/rochester-hills.webp\" srcset=\"assets/rochester-hills.webp 420w\" sizes=\"160px\" width=\"420\" height=\"357\" alt=\"City of Rochester Hills green and blue tree logo\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"timeline-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">June 24, 2026</p><h3>Festival of the Hills</h3><p>OSI takes part in Rochester Hills’ community celebration, continuing our local event service.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.rochesterhills.org/thingstodo/festival_of_the_hills.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">About the festival</a></div></article>\n<article id=\"museum-event\" class=\"timeline-entry reveal\" tabindex=\"-1\"><figure class=\"timeline-picture museum\"><img src=\"assets/museum-farmhouse.webp\" srcset=\"assets/museum-farmhouse.webp 784w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 85vw, 40vw\" width=\"784\" height=\"500\" alt=\"The historic farmhouse at Rochester Hills Museum at Van Hoosen Farm, surrounded by trees and gardens\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"timeline-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Community volunteering</p><h3>Rochester Hills Museum at Van Hoosen Farm</h3><p>OSI volunteered at the Rochester Hills Museum at Van Hoosen Farm as part of our community event service.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.rochesterhills.org/departments/parks_and_natural_resources/museum/index.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visit the museum</a></div></article>\n<article id=\"international-academy-food-service-day\" class=\"timeline-entry reveal\" tabindex=\"-1\"><figure class=\"timeline-picture collaborator\"><img src=\"assets/international-academy-logo.webp\" srcset=\"assets/international-academy-logo.webp 192w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 85vw, 40vw\" width=\"192\" height=\"182\" alt=\"International Academy official IA and globe logo\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></figure><div class=\"timeline-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Community volunteering</p><h3>International Academy Food Service Day</h3><p>OSI participated in Food Service Day with International Academy as part of our food-related community service.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.iatoday.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visit International Academy</a></div></article></div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n",
  "recognition": "<div class=\"wrap recognition\" id=\"recognition\"><div class=\"recognition-number\">5<span>×</span></div><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Recognizing service</p><h3>Presidential Volunteer<br><em>Service Awards</em></h3><p>OSI members have received five Presidential Volunteer Service Awards.</p></div><figure class=\"recognition-photo\"><img src=\"assets/pvsa-medallions.jpg\" width=\"1803\" height=\"1202\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Silver, gold, and bronze President’s Volunteer Service Award medals with red, white, and blue ribbons\"><figcaption>Award medals · Image: <a href=\"https://www.american.edu/student-affairs/volunteer/pvsa.cfm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">American University</a></figcaption></figure></div>",
